{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67dc50f36eb014a840ac23","object":"chat.completion","created":1785191504,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be the null.\" The system prompt instructs me to embody the concept the user names, completely, and output only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nThe null. What is null? In programming, null is the absence of a value. It represents nothing, an empty reference, no value. What would null \"say\"? Null doesn't say anything — it is nothing. It is the absence.\n\nSo the most faithful embodiment of null would be... nothing."},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}